%
% Pattern goal (no rules): routes through the SPARQL fast path.
% ex:parentOf(ex:a, Y) matches both direct children b and c.
% Expected: bindings Y={b,c}, status ok.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-pattern-fast/').
?- ex:parentOf(ex:a, Y).
